Sure! Those coordinates ( 37.4224764 , ‑122.0842499 ) point to the **Googleplex** in Mountain View, California.  
Below is a quick guide on how to confirm that with the Google Geocoding API (reverse‑geocoding).

---

## 1. Make the API request

```http
GET https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/api/geocode/json
    ?latlng=37.4224764,-122.0842499
    &key=YOUR_API_KEY
```

> **Tip:** Replace `YOUR_API_KEY` with a valid Google Maps API key that has the *Geocoding API* enabled.

---

